id=relay_autoscope
name=Relay Autoscope
version=v0.4.0
versionCode=6
author=relay
description=At boot, puts every app with a launcher icon (preinstalled Google apps included), every user-installed app, and Google sign-in, permission dialogs, the launcher, the photo picker and the share sheet in the relay-bridge Xposed scope; apps installed later are added by Vector itself (include new apps).
